{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈────啾唔！啊～好冷……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1427", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……或许是我多事了，不过稍微……克制一下喷嚏比较好吧……”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我哪可能做到那种像女人一样的事。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1428", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早晨，好久没有跟纱凪两人在社团教室里独处了。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前明明常有这种情况的说。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近两人的时间总是错开。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会冷的话，穿上外套比较好吧？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“穿外套不方便行动我不喜欢。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1429", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是感冒的话就得不偿失了。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“穿制服还要穿外套太麻烦了。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1430", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么怕麻烦的人不会加入这个社团吧。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1431", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，真正的理由是？”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是不能对其他人说的事情吧？", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "该不会是像濑名同学一样注重服仪……之类的。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“绝对不准跟别人说喔！”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1432", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，当然了。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1433", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪感觉很冷地双手摩擦取暖，还呵了口气。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看起来就觉得好可怜……", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实我家附近的阿姨……”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1434", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，你家附近的阿姨怎么了？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……她每天早上都会出来打扫家门口，也会跟我打招呼。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1436", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她说小纱凪总是很有活力呢……”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1437", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，然后？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋，都被阿姨那样说了，就算冬天也得穿短袖短裤才行吧！”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1438", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“蛤？”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“阿姨很看好我啊。所以我在阿姨面前必须表现得很有活力才可以。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1439", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果在冬天穿上外套的话……”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1440", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她就不会再说‘小纱凪总是很有活力’了吧！”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1441", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呃。这我该怎么回应她才好？", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道该说她是对阿姨莫名贴心，还是说脑袋接错线……", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，很有她的风格。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可恶，想笑的话就笑吧！所以我才不想说的嘛……”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1442", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "pn0386", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔……熊喵你在啊，我好冷让我抱一下～”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1443", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜噜～！？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "pn0387", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊……你毛茸茸的好温暖喔……”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1444", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "pn0388", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着抱起熊喵用脸颊磨蹭的纱凪，突然觉得自己穿着外套有点不好意思。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇！？你干嘛啦！？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1445", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没干嘛，看你这么冷想说把外套借你。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只是想帮她披上外套而已，没想到她反应这么大。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谁要穿你的外套啦！我有熊喵了，你自己穿！”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1446", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是你感冒才刚好，不要让身体着凉比较好喔。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1447", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拿去穿吧，纱凪。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不需要。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1448", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你还是一样这么爱逞强……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我又不是自己想要才逞强的。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1449", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪像在自言自语，表情显得很落寞。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，她还是没打算接下外套。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有女朋友的男人，随便就对其他女人温柔是不行的。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1450", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你在跟美羽学姐交往吧？”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1451", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你发现了吗……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然了。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1452", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还以为一定会被纱凪骂，没想到她这么冷静。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "pn0389", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没事的。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1453", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她对着怀里的熊喵说，然后把它轻轻放在桌上。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，我以为你会强硬反对。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1454", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我加入社团的时候，纱凪就非常反对了……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算是现在，社团里有你这样的人我还是很不爽。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1455", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那为什么你没生气？”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有生气的理由。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1456", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1457", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然很不甘心，但我认为你是配得上美羽学姐的男性……”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1458", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我迟迟没有对大家说出跟美羽学姐的关系的理由。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因为纱凪的存在太重要了。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我以为她一定不会认可我们的关系……", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我认为美羽学姐一定最想得到纱凪的祝福。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感觉得到她们之间的羁绊，同时也羡慕她们两人的关系。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该道谢的人是我。”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1459", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾教了我很多事。多亏了你，我觉得自己能成为‘好女人’了。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1460", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得现在的纱凪就是好女人了。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼，你懂我什么？”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1461", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……我知道自己连纱凪的百分之一都不了解。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，我知道你是即使有气喘，还是养了２只猫的善良女孩。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1462", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要勉强自己喔。因为我小时候也有气喘。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以我很明白那种痛苦。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1463", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了。去拜托学园长，借一台没有在用的暖炉来好了。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……加油喔。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1464", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要让美羽学姐幸福喔。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1465", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪……”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我这样并不是支持新吾的意思喔。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1466", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我只是希望美羽学姐幸福而已。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1467", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了……你买好要送美羽学姐的圣诞礼物了吗？”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1468", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听她这样一问，我才发现自己完全忘了。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对喔，圣诞节就快到了……", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……男人都这样。你一定什么都没考虑吧？”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1469", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，现在开始考虑。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拿你没办法～嗯，今年的休业式是２１日啊……”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1470", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，休业式结束后去买礼物吧！”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1471", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……去买礼物是一起去吗？”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我不相信你的品味。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1472", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟男朋友第一次度过的圣诞节，不可以让美羽学姐失望吧！”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1473", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是不好吧，休业式后还让你陪我……”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不是说了才不是为了你吗？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1474", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“痛！？”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一掌拍在我的肩膀上，然后露出恶作剧的笑容。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，染血圣诞节要拉开序幕了……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "sn1475", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对。有哪里不对……", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……欸？圣诞节？”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。平安夜那天你有空吗？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……抱歉喔。那天排打工了……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1781", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那２５日怎么样？”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那天下午也要打工。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1782", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊……”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本想趁早约她的，没想到她的行程已经排好了。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好遗憾。好想跟美羽学姐一起过圣诞节啊……", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“平安夜那天，打工结束后可以吗？虽然会拖到很晚……”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1783", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没问题，但学姐很辛苦吧？工作后还要见面……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，我也没问题。虽然时间很短，但还是想见面呢。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1784", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐……”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，谢谢你来约我。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1785", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使到现在我也偶尔会想。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个人是我的女朋友这件事，该不会只是梦吧？", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是眼前学姐的笑容毫无疑问是真实的。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还摸得到温暖的手。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，学姐。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1786", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我最喜欢美羽学姐了。或许是喜欢到你会觉得烦的喜欢。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1787", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……只是突然想说喜欢而已。所以，抱歉。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说了相当支离破碎的的话。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说喜欢又道歉也莫名其妙。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过……", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被你这样一说，我也变得想说喜欢喜欢了啦～”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "mu1788", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能被这个人这样说，我觉得自己是世界上最幸福的男人了。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
